            "value": "Adobe Premiere Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CSV 为 UTF-8，按实体文件的每个目标副本列行；Filename 为该文件实际名称，ImportItemFilename 为关联导入项名称，来源地址、来源预期大小和拍摄参数为该导入项记录。未保存文件及缺失目标也有行。为防表格软件把文本当作公式，危险起始字符添加单引号；原始字符串保存在 JSON 中。每次导出生成新报告 ID 和新目录，不覆盖旧报告。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The CSV is UTF-8 with one row per destination copy of each file. Filename is the file's actual name and ImportItemFilename is the related import item; source address, expected source size and shooting parameters come from that import item. Unsaved files and missing destinations also have rows. To keep spreadsheet apps from treating text as formulas, risky leading characters get a single quote; the original strings are kept in the JSON. Each export creates a new report ID and folder and never overwrites an earlier report."
          }
        }
      }
    },
