    "PDF 中的缩略图和抽帧从当前可访问且大小匹配的已记录副本生成，只用于识别素材。原片无法解码时可尝试代理并标明来源；无法读取时保留占位，不把缩略图当作核验结果。照片逐项分页，视频按已记录卷号分组并依次排列，不同视频留间隔，同一视频排满后换行，整份报告共用相同时间比例，无卷号时明确列为未记录卷号。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thumbnails and frames in the PDF are made from recorded copies that are accessible now and match in size, and are only for identifying media. If an original cannot be decoded, a proxy may be used and is marked as such; unreadable media keeps a placeholder. Thumbnails are not verification results. Photos are paginated item by item; videos are grouped by recorded roll and laid out in order, with a gap between clips and long clips wrapping to the next line, all at the same time scale. Videos without a roll are listed under No Roll Recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
