    "USB 连接：用数据线把相机接到 Mac，相机会出现在可用设备里。把相机的 USB 连接方式设为“MTP”或“PC 遥控”（索尼）；设为“大容量存储”时，存储卡会像读卡器一样出现。索尼相机在“PC 遥控”模式下还可以右键选择“联机拍摄”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "USB: connect the camera to your Mac with a cable and it appears under Available Devices. Set the camera's USB connection mode to “MTP” or “PC Remote” (Sony); in “Mass Storage” mode the memory card appears like a card reader. Sony cameras in “PC Remote” mode can also be right-clicked to choose “Tethered Shooting”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "XML 写入失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Failed to write XML: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "XXH64 是记录的素材校验算法；与来源内容核对、本地读回核对和旧记录分别列示。Wi-Fi 来源无法取得相机端源文件校验值，不按原卡端到端核对承诺。仅代理任务明确不包含原片。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "XXH64 is the recorded media checksum algorithm. Comparison with the source, local read-back and legacy records are listed separately. Wi-Fi sources cannot provide a camera-side checksum, so no end-to-end check against the original card is claimed. Proxy-only jobs explicitly exclude originals."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "XXH64：": {
