          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Canon camera refused the connection. This Mac may not be paired with it yet. On the camera, go to “Wi-Fi › Remote control (EOS Utility)”, choose to pair with a computer, then reconnect in MiniDiT and confirm on the camera."
