    "分成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Split Into"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分析当前这一帧实时取景的曝光，返回数字而不是图片：亮度平均值和百分位（p1–p99，0–100）、高光 / 暗部截断比例、R/G/B 各自到顶的比例、按档位（相对 18% 中灰，−6…+5，和伪色同一套换算）的像素分布、中位数相对中灰的档数、32 档亮度直方图。会自动判断取景是 S-Log3 还是 Rec.709。zebra 给一个 0–100 的阈值时另外返回亮度不低于它的像素比例。需要取景开启。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analyzes the exposure of the current live view frame and returns numbers instead of an image: mean brightness and percentiles (p1–p99, 0–100), highlight/shadow clipping ratios, the ratio of R/G/B each clipped at the top, the pixel distribution by stop (relative to 18% middle gray, −6…+5, same conversion as false color), the median's stops from middle gray, and a 32-bin luminance histogram. Detects automatically whether live view is S-Log3 or Rec.709. When zebra is given a 0–100 threshold, also returns the ratio of pixels at or above it. Requires live view to be on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分类记录": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sort"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分页列出当前筛选范围内的拍摄素材；id 是拍摄 ID，files 是关联原始文件。用 assets.filter 调整范围。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lists media in the current filter scope, paginated; id is the shot ID and files are the associated original files. Use assets.filter to adjust the scope."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分页读取批次文件记录，包括原片、代理/XML、副本实际路径、XXH64 及备份结果。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads batch file records, paginated, including originals, proxies/XML, actual copy paths, XXH64 and backup results."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换为“%@”工作流程？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to the “%@” workflow?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换拍照 / 录像 / S&Q / 间隔录像（改曝光模式到另一组，回读确认）。exposure 不给时沿用当前的 P/A/S/M/auto（照片 M ↔ 录像 M）。曝光模式由相机拨盘控制（仅显示）时会先把 PriorityKey 改成 PC 优先，结束联机时改回。α7 V 上拨杆位置不影响远程切换。当前模式见 tether.status 的 info.shootingMode。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switches between photo / movie / S&Q / interval recording (changes the exposure mode to the other group and reads it back to confirm). If exposure is omitted, keeps the current P/A/S/M/auto (photo M ↔ movie M). When the exposure mode is controlled by the camera dial (display only), PriorityKey is first switched to PC priority and restored when tethering ends. On the α7 V the switch lever position does not affect remote switching. The current mode is in info.shootingMode of tether.status."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换拍照、录像、S&Q。相机拨杆位置不影响；需要时会临时改为电脑优先，结束联机时改回。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch between Photo, Movie, and S&Q. The camera's switch position doesn't matter; PC priority is turned on temporarily when needed and restored when tethering ends."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换来源…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch Source…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换至“全部”即可查看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to All to see them."
