    "切换静音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toggle Mute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "列出存储卡上的文件（新的在前）：文件名、卡上路径、大小、拍摄时间、类型、卡槽。用远程传输读取，联机时可以直接用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lists files on the memory card (newest first): file name, path on card, size, capture time, type and card slot. Reads via remote transfer, so it can be used while tethered."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "列出已有项目及当前选中的导入目标。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
