    "列出已连接的相机、卡和可打开的挂载存储卡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lists connected cameras, cards and mounted memory cards that can be opened."
