        }
      }
    },
    "列出最近的导入批次摘要；可按项目 UUID 筛选。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lists recent import batch summaries; can be filtered by project UUID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "列出相机报告的全部属性：编号、SDK 名称、数据类型、是否可写（不可写时说明是仅显示还是未启用）、当前值、可选值或取值范围。已核实的属性带可读写法（1/1000、F5.6、3200K、ST、+3）。可按名称或编号筛选。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lists all properties reported by the camera: code, SDK name, data type, whether writable (and if not, whether display-only or disabled), current value, and options or value range. Verified properties include a readable form (1/1000, F5.6, 3200K, ST, +3). Can be filtered by name or code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
