    "历史已校验 %lld / %lld，当前可访问 %lld / %lld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verified when recorded %lld / %lld, accessible now %lld / %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "历史核验依据来自已保存的记录；导出时仅检查路径可读和文件大小，不重新计算素材内容校验值。同大小的内容变化无法由本次检查发现。离线目标保留过去的核验事实，但当前不可访问不等于可以完成交付。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Past verification comes from saved records. At export, only path readability and file size are checked; media checksums are not recalculated, so content changes that keep the same size are not detected. Offline destinations keep their past verification, but a copy that is not accessible now is not ready for delivery."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "历史记录": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
