    "取当前的一帧实时取景，返回 JPEG 图像（MCP 中为图片内容）。需要取景开启。给 outFile 时改为把相机送来的原始帧（不缩小、不重新编码）写到该文件，只返回路径、大小和尺寸；文件已存在时报 file_exists，不覆盖。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grabs the current live view frame and returns a JPEG image (image content in MCP). Requires live view to be on. With outFile, writes the original frame sent by the camera (not scaled or re-encoded) to that file instead and returns only the path, size and dimensions; if the file exists, reports file_exists and does not overwrite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取景": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live View"
          }
        }
      }
    },
