    "导入到 Lightroom Classic 前，须先安装 MiniDiT 插件（安装至 Lightroom 的 Modules 文件夹，将自动加载）。若 Lightroom Classic 正在运行，安装后须重新打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before importing to Lightroom Classic, install the MiniDiT plug-in (it goes in Lightroom's Modules folder and loads automatically). If Lightroom Classic is running, reopen it after installing."
