            "value": "After Import"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入完成后打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open after import"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入完成后，视频将加入与 MiniDiT 项目同名的 Premiere Pro 项目；该项目不存在时将在“影片”文件夹中新建。\n\n使用前，请在“设置 › 连接”中安装 MiniDiT 插件，并在 Premiere Pro 的“窗口 › UXP 插件”中打开 MiniDiT 面板。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After import, videos are added to the Premiere Pro project with the same name as the MiniDiT project. If that project doesn’t exist, it’s created in the Movies folder.\n\nBefore using this, install the MiniDiT plug-in in Settings › Connections, and open the MiniDiT panel from Window › UXP Plugins in Premiere Pro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入完成后，视频将加入与 MiniDiT 项目同名的 Resolve 项目；该项目不存在时将自动新建。切换项目前，将先保存 Resolve 当前打开的项目。\n\n请在 DaVinci Resolve 偏好设置中将“外部脚本使用”设为“本地”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After import, videos are added to the Resolve project with the same name as the MiniDiT project. If that project doesn’t exist, it’s created automatically. The project currently open in Resolve is saved before switching.\n\nIn DaVinci Resolve preferences, set “External scripting using” to “Local”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入完成后，视频将加入与 MiniDiT 项目同名的剪映草稿素材区；该草稿不存在时将自动新建。草稿一经在剪映中打开，即由剪映加密，此后 MiniDiT 无法再向其中加入素材，需在剪映中手动导入。\n\n草稿保存于剪映的默认草稿位置。如已在剪映中更改草稿位置，请恢复为默认位置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After import, videos are added to the media area of the Jianying Pro draft with the same name as the MiniDiT project. If that draft doesn’t exist, it’s created automatically. Once a draft is opened in Jianying Pro, Jianying Pro encrypts it, and MiniDiT can no longer add media to it; import them manually in Jianying Pro instead.\n\nDrafts are saved in Jianying Pro’s default draft location. If you changed the draft location in Jianying Pro, restore it to the default."
          }
        }
      }
    },
