    "开始索尼联机拍摄（Wi-Fi，相机需开启“电脑遥控”）。不传 host 时用当前连接的索尼相机。会断开当前来源，改为遥控相机；拍到的照片先存入联机缓存，并按当前项目设置自动导入（未选项目时等待）。连接异步进行，轮询 tether.status。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starts Sony tethered shooting (Wi-Fi; the camera must have PC Remote on). Without host, uses the currently connected Sony camera. Disconnects the current source and switches to remote control; shots are first saved to the tether cache and auto-imported according to the current project settings (waits if no project is selected). Connects asynchronously; poll tether.status."
          }
        }
      }
    },
