    "录一段指定秒数的视频，等片段出现在存储卡上；给 outDir 时把视频和同名 XML 下载到该目录（不覆盖）。返回片段信息和本地路径；下载时附实际时长 durationSeconds（α7 V 上开始、停止各有延迟，2 秒约录到 1.5 秒）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records a video of the given length in seconds and waits for the clip to appear on the memory card; with outDir, downloads the video and its XML to that folder (no overwrite). Returns clip info and local paths; downloads include the actual duration, durationSeconds (on the α7 V start and stop each have a delay, so 2 seconds records about 1.5 seconds)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
