    "执行 import.preview 返回的 planId。选择、设备连接或设置变化后必须重新预览。同一 planId 重试只返回同一批次，不重复启动。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs the planId returned by import.preview. Preview again after the selection, device connection or settings change. Retrying the same planId returns the same batch without starting it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "报告只涵盖所选项目的导入记录，不代表已扫描或完整拷贝整张存储卡。导入项可包含重复尝试；文件数、字节及已知时长按这些记录累计，不能当作项目去重统计。未记录的拍摄参数留空，不从当前偏好补写历史。源拍摄日期原文保留在 CaptureDateRaw，UTC 字段为导入时已解析的时间，不是机身时钟已经校准的证明。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This report covers only the import records of the selected project. It does not mean the whole memory card was scanned or fully copied. Import items can include repeated attempts; file counts, bytes and known durations add up these records and are not deduplicated project totals. Shooting parameters that were not recorded are left blank and are not filled in from current preferences. The original capture date text is kept in CaptureDateRaw; UTC fields are the times parsed at import, not proof that the camera clock was set correctly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "报告编号": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
