      }
    },
    "拍一张并等待这次的所有文件（RAW + HEIF/JPEG）完整写到电脑后才返回：文件路径、大小和拍摄前的参数快照。照片同时保存在存储卡上。给 outDir 时另复制一份到该目录，重名报错、不覆盖。超时报错。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Takes a photo and waits until all of its files (RAW + HEIF/JPEG) are fully written to the computer before returning: file paths, sizes and a snapshot of the settings before the shot. The photo is also saved on the memory card. With outDir, also copies it to that folder; name conflicts are an error, with no overwrite. Errors on timeout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拍摄": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shoot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拍摄一张（半按对焦、全按、松开）。立即返回；照片接收和自动导入通过 tether.status 的 shotCount、lastShot 和 app.status 的 progress 观察。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Takes a photo (half-press to focus, full press, release). Returns immediately; watch photo reception and auto-import via shotCount and lastShot in tether.status and progress in app.status."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拍摄信息": {
