            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subfolders by card slot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按取景画面的亮度百分比": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By live view brightness percentage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按拍摄日期建立文件夹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folders by capture date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按文件名从存储卡下载到 outDir；视频同时写出内嵌的 XML（C0001M01.XML）。目标已有同名文件时报 file_exists，一个都不下载。两个卡槽有同名文件时用 slot 指定（默认卡槽 1）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloads files from the memory card by file name to outDir; for videos, also writes out the embedded XML (C0001M01.XML). If a file with the same name already exists at the destination, reports file_exists and downloads nothing. When both card slots have a file with the same name, specify slot (defaults to slot 1)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按日期和可选事件创建并选择项目；同名项目复用。只创建项目，不导入文件。可指定项目类型（photos 仅照片、videos 仅视频、all 两者，默认 all；同名项目沿用原类型）和照片、视频的默认根目录。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Creates and selects a project by date and optional event; an existing project with the same name is reused. Only creates the project and does not import files. Can specify the project type (photos for photos only, videos for videos only, all for both; defaults to all; an existing project keeps its type) and the default root folders for photos and videos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按时间分场次": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Split Scenes by Time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
