    "按项目名称建立文件夹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folders by project name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按顺序设置一个或多个属性，每项设置后回读确认；读回值与请求不符、不可写、取值不合法、相机忙时报错并说明原因，已生效的项会列出。assignments 每项写成 NAME=VALUE，VALUE 可用可读写法或原始值，如 ISO=400、ShutterSpeed=1/1000、FNumber=F5.6、WhiteBalance=ColorTemp、Colortemp=3200K、CreativeLook=ST、CreativeLook_Contrast=+3。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets one or more properties in order, reading each back to confirm; reports an error with the reason if the read-back value differs from the request, the property is not writable, the value is invalid or the camera is busy, and lists the items already applied. Write each assignment as NAME=VALUE; VALUE can be the readable form or the raw value, e.g. ISO=400, ShutterSpeed=1/1000, FNumber=F5.6, WhiteBalance=ColorTemp, Colortemp=3200K, CreativeLook=ST, CreativeLook_Contrast=+3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
