    "推荐手动导入，并保留原卡文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manual import recommended, keeping files on the original card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推荐按卷号整理视频、手动导入并保留原卡。应用推荐设置会关闭自动导入和导入后删除，仅在未自定义命名时调整视频文件夹。两种流程都可以使用所有功能。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommended: organize videos by roll, import manually, and keep the original cards. Applying the recommended settings turns off automatic import and delete after import, and changes the video folder only if naming hasn’t been customized. All features are available in both workflows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推荐按日期、事件整理视频。应用推荐设置只会将团队默认的视频文件夹恢复为按事件整理，保留自定义命名和其他选项。两种流程都可以使用所有功能。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommended: organize videos by date and event. Applying the recommended settings only restores the team default video folder to organize by event; custom naming and other options are kept. All features are available in both workflows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
