          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放大对焦（0xD254，MF 时可用）。不带参数时返回现在的倍率、位置和可选倍率；ratio 是倍率 ×10（0 关、10 = ×1.0、55 = ×5.5、110 = ×11），x、y 是放大位置（640×480 坐标，不给时用相机当前位置）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Focus magnifier (0xD254, available in MF). Without parameters, returns the current magnification, position and available ratios; ratio is the magnification ×10 (0 off, 10 = ×1.0, 55 = ×5.5, 110 = ×11), and x, y are the magnified position (640×480 coordinates; the camera's current position is used if omitted)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放大检查焦点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Magnify to Check Focus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放大缩略图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
