    "查询联机拍摄状态：是否连接、拍摄模式、电量、各曝光参数的当前值与可选值、对焦/录像状态、已接收数量、最近一张的文件与 EXIF、自动导入设置、联机缓存位置、本次改过的属性及原值（changedProperties），以及命令日志位置（logPath：每条 tether.* 命令和结果一行 JSON）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queries the tethered shooting status: connection, shooting mode, battery, current and available values of each exposure setting, focus/recording state, number of shots received, file and EXIF of the latest shot, auto-import settings, tether cache location, properties changed in this session with their original values (changedProperties), and the command log location (logPath: one JSON line per tether.* command and result)."
          }
