    "百分比都是占画面像素的比例；stopZones 相对 18% 中灰，−6 含更暗、+5 含更亮。分析的是传到电脑的取景画面（监看 LUT 打开时已套 LUT）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Percentages are shares of the frame's pixels; stopZones are relative to 18% middle gray, with −6 including darker and +5 including brighter. The analysis uses the live view frame sent to the computer (with the LUT applied when the monitor LUT is on)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
