    "相机": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机 %@ 已开启“访问身份验证”。请在相机上依次打开 MENU → 网络 → 网络选项 → 访问身份验证信息，并输入其中显示的用户名和密码。账户信息仅保存在本机钥匙串中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Access Authentication is on for camera %@. On the camera, go to MENU → Network → Network Option → Access Authen. Info, and enter the user name and password shown there. The credentials are stored only in this Mac’s keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机上没有确认连接。请在相机上按 OK 允许这台 Mac 连接后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection wasn't confirmed on the camera. Press OK on the camera to allow this Mac, then try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机上没有确认连接。请在相机屏幕上点“允许”后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection wasn't confirmed on the camera. Tap “Allow” on the camera screen and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机上没有确认配对。请重新连接，核对配对码后在相机上确认。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pairing wasn't confirmed on the camera. Reconnect, check the pairing code, and confirm on the camera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
