        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera disconnected. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机已断开，正在重新连接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera disconnected. Reconnecting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机当前的网络配置已与另一台电脑配对。请在相机的“连接到电脑”中切换到为这台 Mac 建立的配置，或新建一个配置后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera's current network setting is paired with another computer. In the camera's “Connect to Computer” menu, switch to the setting made for this Mac, or create a new one and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机忙，没有接受 %@ 的设置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera is busy and didn’t accept the %@ setting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机忙，请稍后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera is busy. Try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机拒绝了登录。请核对相机「访问身份验证设置」里的用户名和密码。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera rejected the login. Check the user name and password in the camera's Access Authentication settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机拒绝了连接（代码 %u）。请确认：①相机「访问认证」已关闭；②通过路由器连接时已在相机上完成配对；③手机上的 Creators' App 没有连着相机。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera refused the connection (code %u). Check that: ① Access Authentication is off on the camera; ② pairing is done on the camera when connecting through a router; ③ Creators' App on your phone isn't connected to the camera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机拒绝了遥控通道：%@。请确认相机已开启「遥控拍摄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera rejected the remote channel: %@. Make sure Remote Shooting is on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机拒绝设置 %@（响应 %@）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera refused to set %@ (response %@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机指纹未确认，已取消连接。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera fingerprint wasn't confirmed. Connection canceled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机时间尚未对齐": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera time not yet aligned"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机暂时不开放存储卡（%@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera isn't making the memory card available right now (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机未提供代理。可缓存原片后播放，原文件保留在相机上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera has no proxy. You can cache the original to play it; the original file stays on the camera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机没有允许进入取白待机（检查拍摄模式和菜单状态）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera didn't allow white balance capture standby (check the shooting mode and menu state)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机没有响应数据连接（UDP %u）。请确认电脑已连上相机的 Wi-Fi。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera didn't respond on the data connection (UDP %u). Make sure your Mac is connected to the camera's Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机没有响应索尼遥控协议。请确认相机已开启「遥控拍摄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera didn’t respond to the Sony remote protocol. Make sure Remote Shooting is turned on in the camera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机没有回应（%@）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera didn't respond (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机没有开放存储卡访问。请确认：①相机固件已更新到最新；②相机里有存储卡；③相机处于「遥控拍摄」Wi-Fi 连接。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera isn’t allowing memory card access. Make sure that: (1) the camera firmware is up to date; (2) there’s a memory card in the camera; (3) the camera is connected over Wi-Fi in Remote Shooting mode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相机没有报告 %@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera did not report %@."
          }
        }
