    "结束联机拍摄并关闭联机缓存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "End tethered shooting and close the tether cache"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "结束联机拍摄，断开相机。联机缓存里的照片仍作为来源保留，可继续选择和导入。断开前总会把 PriorityKey 交还相机（连接时改成了 PC 优先）；restoreSettings=true 时，先把本次用 tether.set_properties 改过的属性逐项改回原值（后改的先还原），结果在 restored 里列出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ends tethered shooting and disconnects the camera. Photos in the tether cache remain as a source and can still be selected and imported. Before disconnecting, PriorityKey is always handed back to the camera (it was switched to PC priority on connection); with restoreSettings=true, properties changed in this session with tether.set_properties are first restored one by one to their original values (latest change first), listed in restored."
          }
        }
      }
    },
