    "读取存储卡失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t read the memory card: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "读取指定属性的当前值（现读，不用缓存）。名称用 tether.properties 里的 SDK 名称，或 0xD20D 这样的编号；常用别名：ISO、Shutter、Aperture、ColorTemp。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads the current value of the given properties (read live, not cached). Names are SDK names from tether.properties, or codes like 0xD20D; common aliases: ISO, Shutter, Aperture, ColorTemp."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "读镜头信息 0x9223（跟焦位置换算成距离的表；录像模式、0xE086 = 1 时可用）。type 2 = 米、1 = 英尺。返回原始数据的十六进制。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads lens info 0x9223 (a table converting focus positions to distances; available in movie mode when 0xE086 = 1). type 2 = meters, 1 = feet. Returns the raw data in hexadecimal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "调出记忆": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
