    "调整数值（当前 %@）…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adjust Value (Currently %@)…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "调整曝光参数。value（原始值）、label（tether.status 的选项文字，如 1/250、F4.0、400）或 step（相对档位，正数增大）三选一。当前拍摄模式下由相机决定的参数不能调整。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adjusts an exposure setting. Give exactly one of value (raw value), label (option text from tether.status, such as 1/250, F4.0, 400) or step (relative steps; positive increases). Settings determined by the camera in the current shooting mode cannot be adjusted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "调整未导入条件、搜索和日期；媒体范围跟随当前项目的类型。days=[] 表示全部日期。返回当前可选择素材。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adjusts the not-imported condition, search and dates; the media scope follows the current project's type. days=[] means all dates. Returns the currently selectable media."
          }
        }
      }
    },
