    },
    "这台 Mac 没有可用的 Wi-Fi。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Mac has no Wi-Fi available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "进入取白待机失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't enter white balance capture standby: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "远程自定义白平衡（取白）：白平衡切到自定义 slot，进入取白待机，在取白框位置取白，等完成后返回测得的色温和 G–M / A–B，结果存进该槽位并保持选中。取白前请把相机对准灰卡或白纸。probe=true 时只进入待机、返回各状态和可取白区域后取消，不改槽位里的结果。position 是取白框位置 x << 16 | y（640×480 坐标），默认画面中央 (320, 240)。trace 记录每一步的状态（0xD270：0 无效、1 待机、2 取白中、3 相机端操作中）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remote custom white balance (measure): switches white balance to custom slot, enters measurement standby, measures at the measurement frame position, and when done returns the measured color temperature and G–M / A–B; the result is stored in that slot and kept selected. Point the camera at a gray card or white paper first. With probe=true, only enters standby, returns the states and measurable area, then cancels without changing the slot's result. position is the measurement frame position x << 16 | y (640×480 coordinates), defaulting to the frame center (320, 240). trace records the state of each step (0xD270: 0 invalid, 1 standby, 2 measuring, 3 operating on camera)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "远程触摸（相当于点按相机屏幕）：在 x、y 处按机身的触摸功能对焦或开始跟踪（0xD283，例如 11 = 触摸跟踪、9 = 触摸对焦）。坐标是取景画面映射到的 640×480（x 0–639、y 0–479，左上为原点）。cancel=true 取消触摸对焦 / 跟踪。相机报告不可用时返回 touch_unavailable。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remote touch (like tapping the camera screen): focuses or starts tracking at x, y using the body's touch function (0xD283, e.g. 11 = touch tracking, 9 = touch focus). Coordinates map the live view frame to 640×480 (x 0–639, y 0–479, origin top left). cancel=true cancels touch focus / tracking. Returns touch_unavailable when the camera reports it unavailable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "远程调焦。不带参数时返回调焦用的属性、范围、镜头现在的位置和是否手动对焦；position 移到该位置（值越大越近，α7 V 实测），seconds > 0 时在这么多秒内平滑拉过去（返回时可能还在拉）。优先用跟焦 0xE088（范围就是镜头行程），不可用时用绝对位置 0xE042。自动对焦时相机可能重新对焦，请先把对焦模式改成 MF。返回里 distanceMeters / distanceText 是现在的对焦距离（有这支镜头的距离表时才有：录像模式会读，拍照模式用缓存）。centimeters 按距离调焦（例如 200 = 2 米），infinity=true 对到无穷远；这两个只在录像模式（跟焦）可用，distanceByTarget 表示现在能不能这样用。position、centimeters、infinity 三选一。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remote focus adjustment. Without parameters, returns the focus properties, range, current lens position and whether manual focus is on; position moves to that position (larger values are closer, measured on the α7 V), and with seconds > 0 it pulls smoothly over that many seconds (it may still be moving when this returns). Prefers follow focus 0xE088 (its range is the lens travel), falling back to absolute position 0xE042. In autofocus the camera may refocus, so switch the focus mode to MF first. distanceMeters / distanceText in the result are the current focus distance (only when a distance table for this lens is available: read in movie mode, cached in photo mode). centimeters focuses by distance (e.g. 200 = 2 meters) and infinity=true focuses to infinity; these two are only available in movie mode (follow focus), and distanceByTarget tells whether they can be used now. Give only one of position, centimeters or infinity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连不上相机的 SSH 端口（22）。请确认手机连着相机的 Wi-Fi。（%@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't reach the camera's SSH port (22). Make sure the phone is on the camera's Wi-Fi. (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连拍": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuous Shooting"
          }
        }
      }
