    "附带的 ASC MHL 目录保留可取得的历史链及清单，未修改其中的路径或校验事实。其相对路径基于原素材目标根目录，报告文件夹不包含素材；在素材根目录中使用兼容工具复核。清单不可取得时会明确列出，不重新编造。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The included ASC MHL folders keep the history chain and manifests that were available, with paths and checksums unchanged. Their relative paths are based on the original destination root; the report folder contains no media, so re-check with a compatible tool in the media root. Manifests that could not be obtained are listed explicitly and are never recreated."
          }
        }
      }
    },
